WEBVTT

01:36.630 --> 01:39.870
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.080 --> 01:41.970
[Episode 23]

01:48.870 --> 01:50.520
Sister Hua is busy and doesn't have time to see you.

01:50.550 --> 01:51.350
-Sister Hua.
-Sister Hua.

01:51.360 --> 01:52.070
Sister Hua.

01:52.090 --> 01:53.090
Sister Hua!

01:53.130 --> 01:53.930
Sister Hua.

01:53.960 --> 01:55.009
Sorry, Sister Hua.

01:55.350 --> 01:56.759
We want to quit too.

01:59.360 --> 02:00.490
Have you all thought it through?

02:02.670 --> 02:03.750
Yes.

02:05.200 --> 02:07.330
Even if it means delivering over 50 more orders a day?

02:08.030 --> 02:09.229
We're not afraid of hard work.

02:09.919 --> 02:10.759
We're afraid of poverty.

02:11.790 --> 02:12.720
Please don't overthink it.

02:13.300 --> 02:14.220
Nowadays,

02:14.250 --> 02:15.560
everyone out there is doing the same.

02:16.110 --> 02:17.130
The workload

02:17.160 --> 02:18.250
is getting bigger day by day.

02:18.550 --> 02:19.430
We...

02:19.700 --> 02:21.340
We know you're considerate.

02:22.800 --> 02:25.180
We just want to make money.

02:31.270 --> 02:32.070
I see.

02:33.510 --> 02:34.900
Making money is not a problem.

02:35.280 --> 02:36.579
But don't push yourself too hard.

02:36.670 --> 02:37.660
Try not to get sick.

02:38.250 --> 02:39.570
Hospitals are expensive here.

02:42.079 --> 02:42.829
He,

02:43.700 --> 02:45.050
help settle their accounts.

02:45.360 --> 02:46.430
Fenghua, this...

02:46.829 --> 02:47.930
-Thank you, Sister Hua.
-Thank you, Sister Hua.

02:47.950 --> 02:48.710
Thank you, Sister Hua.

02:51.079 --> 02:52.030
You guys...

03:40.950 --> 03:42.340
Are you crazy?

03:42.360 --> 03:44.370
It's your own shoe, don't blame me.

03:45.300 --> 03:48.040
I was wondering why everyone had left.

03:48.180 --> 03:48.910
No, no, no.

03:48.910 --> 03:50.430
Alright, alright.

03:50.430 --> 03:51.920
Let me tell you some good news.

03:53.070 --> 03:54.540
Our overtime rate

03:54.570 --> 03:56.710
has been controlled at five percent.

03:56.829 --> 03:57.780
Really?

03:58.600 --> 04:00.140
Let's have a late-night snack to celebrate.

04:00.810 --> 04:02.200
You two can celebrate.

04:02.230 --> 04:03.720
I'm going home to catch up on sleep.

04:03.750 --> 04:04.860
I'll wake you up.

04:06.380 --> 04:07.940
Quick, quick, just smell this and you'll wake up.

04:07.960 --> 04:08.840
Take it away.

04:09.440 --> 04:11.660
Let's eat together and then go sleep.

04:11.720 --> 04:13.090
Come on, let's go.

04:13.120 --> 04:14.530
I'm not going, really not going.

04:16.170 --> 04:17.510
You're really not going?

04:17.950 --> 04:19.399
Who is it at this late hour?

04:19.680 --> 04:21.029
Must be a woman.

04:22.790 --> 04:23.790
Oh, Fenghua.

04:26.040 --> 04:28.060
Are you free tomorrow? I'd like to treat you to coffee.

04:30.540 --> 04:32.090
Why won't she invite me for coffee?

04:33.680 --> 04:35.960
I'm free. You can tell her that.

04:35.990 --> 04:37.230
I'm leaving. I'm going home to sleep.

04:39.790 --> 04:41.110
Let's go together!

04:41.130 --> 04:42.190
Hurry up, hurry up.

04:47.140 --> 04:48.680
How have you been doing lately?

04:49.470 --> 04:50.510
Not bad.

04:50.780 --> 04:52.550
I'm the expert canvasser.

04:52.590 --> 04:55.120
I went there and impressed them all in just a couple of days.

04:55.960 --> 04:57.830
Is Wanghe treating you well?

04:58.060 --> 04:59.550
His attitude is impeccable,

04:59.580 --> 05:01.050
but I haven't seen any money yet.

05:01.180 --> 05:02.590
However, I bet

05:02.700 --> 05:03.750
it'll be good.

05:04.880 --> 05:08.110
You didn't discuss payment before starting work? You're something else.

05:08.420 --> 05:10.200
That's Xie Wanghe.

05:10.410 --> 05:11.650
Would he cheat me?

05:12.240 --> 05:13.820
What a joke.

05:14.670 --> 05:16.870
Asking a girl out for coffee during work hours.

05:16.950 --> 05:18.000
Is that appropriate?

05:19.080 --> 05:20.870
Sorry, boss.

05:21.300 --> 05:22.930
It was love at first sight on the street.

05:23.450 --> 05:25.350
Love at first sight?

05:29.520 --> 05:30.280
Waiter.

05:32.090 --> 05:33.120
Bring a cup of coffee.

05:33.150 --> 05:34.590
And an afternoon tea set as well.

05:34.630 --> 05:35.510
Certainly, please wait a moment.

05:38.050 --> 05:39.100
Ms. Xia,

05:39.700 --> 05:40.900
is business not good?

05:40.920 --> 05:42.330
You still have time for coffee?

05:43.780 --> 05:44.900
I'm here to poach someone.

05:46.580 --> 05:47.730
Xingchi.

05:48.230 --> 05:49.280
Come work for me.

05:52.310 --> 05:53.620
Dream on.

05:54.280 --> 05:56.010
We have a labor contract.

05:56.450 --> 05:59.000
If you want to poach him, pay the compensation first.

05:59.260 --> 06:00.140
How much is it?

06:03.510 --> 06:05.230
You're really serious about poaching?

06:05.250 --> 06:06.910
I'm really short-staffed lately.

06:07.880 --> 06:10.160
If he could come, it would save me a lot of trouble.

06:10.600 --> 06:12.050
Where have you been?

06:12.180 --> 06:15.080
To poach someone, you've got to strike first.

06:15.600 --> 06:16.720
It's too late now.

06:17.120 --> 06:19.300
I offer insurance and housing fund. Does he?

06:22.420 --> 06:23.150
Wait...

06:23.170 --> 06:24.330
You're being serious?

06:24.370 --> 06:25.400
I'm serious.

06:26.440 --> 06:28.940
I'm exhausted now. I can't handle it anymore.

06:37.820 --> 06:38.540
Fenghua,

06:39.780 --> 06:40.460
how about this?

06:40.850 --> 06:42.210
I'll subsidize you.

06:42.370 --> 06:43.620
Poach a professional,

06:43.640 --> 06:45.520
someone with management experience.

06:45.550 --> 06:46.659
If you pay enough,

06:46.690 --> 06:48.050
you won't have trouble finding someone.

06:48.080 --> 06:49.730
I've just got things sorted out here.

06:50.210 --> 06:51.480
I can't give you Xingchi.

06:52.540 --> 06:53.300
I'm sorry.

07:08.160 --> 07:11.800
[Fenghua Express]

07:10.460 --> 07:11.020
Fenghua.

07:11.960 --> 07:12.720
Thank you.

07:20.660 --> 07:22.050
Why aren't you eating?

07:22.920 --> 07:24.020
I don't have an appetite.

07:25.600 --> 07:28.180
Are you really childhood friends with Mr. Xie and them?

07:29.720 --> 07:31.300
Why? Doesn't seem like it?

07:32.470 --> 07:33.490
Are you close?

07:34.300 --> 07:36.940
Of course. We grew up in the same courtyard.

07:36.970 --> 07:38.490
Door to door, window to window.

07:38.530 --> 07:40.600
We could even hear each other sleep talking at night.

07:40.620 --> 07:42.300
Then why do they treat you like that?

07:44.560 --> 07:46.770
Are you trying to sow discord now?

07:46.790 --> 07:48.060
No, no, no.

07:55.230 --> 07:56.860
He, call the ambulance!

07:57.770 --> 07:58.350
Fenghua.

07:58.390 --> 08:00.550
Take a rest! Look at your condition!

08:00.570 --> 08:02.770
Don't worry, we're here. Nothing will be lost.

08:05.870 --> 08:06.510
Fenghua!

08:10.260 --> 08:11.030
Don't run!

08:11.060 --> 08:11.870
Get out of the way!

08:11.890 --> 08:13.990
It's none of your business. Move aside, move aside!

08:14.010 --> 08:15.700
He, note down the license plate number.

08:15.730 --> 08:16.520
Move aside, move aside!

08:16.540 --> 08:17.350
Let me tell you,

08:17.380 --> 08:20.180
if you dare to run, it's a hit-and-run. You'll be sentenced.

08:20.210 --> 08:21.180
See that?

08:21.220 --> 08:23.510
There are cameras over there.

08:23.530 --> 08:24.920
Run off to outer space if you can.

08:24.960 --> 08:25.910
I've gotten it, Fenghua.

08:25.350 --> 08:25.800
[Shuntong Express]

08:38.480 --> 08:39.190
Mr. Wei.

08:39.990 --> 08:40.929
How is it?

08:41.120 --> 08:42.400
The driver is over there.

08:42.440 --> 08:43.820
The traffic police are taking notes.

08:43.880 --> 08:44.800
What about the courier?

08:44.820 --> 08:45.750
Sent to the hospital.

08:45.790 --> 08:46.670
He fractured his lower leg.

08:46.800 --> 08:47.770
The rest still needs to be examined.

08:51.220 --> 08:52.210
Don't worry.

08:52.240 --> 08:54.180
We kept an eye on it. Nothing's missing.

08:54.510 --> 08:55.510
It's just this box.

08:55.590 --> 08:56.990
You might need to pay compensation.

09:00.750 --> 09:01.510
Here, cigarette.

09:07.940 --> 09:09.300
It's fortunate you were here.

09:10.230 --> 09:11.110
We're all in the same business.

09:11.130 --> 09:12.370
No need for such formalities.

09:12.390 --> 09:13.970
If there's nothing else, we'll be going now.

09:13.990 --> 09:16.380
You can discuss the accident settlement with the traffic police.

09:18.730 --> 09:24.330
[Steamed Buns]

09:20.760 --> 09:21.340
Fenghua,

09:21.370 --> 09:22.510
are we just leaving like this?

09:22.530 --> 09:24.850
What else? Wait for him to pay you?

09:25.110 --> 09:26.760
He didn't even say thank you.

09:27.560 --> 09:29.460
It doesn't make a difference whether he says it or not.

09:29.640 --> 09:31.000
As long as he thinks it, it's fine.

09:31.100 --> 09:31.980
I'm afraid he doesn't.

09:32.000 --> 09:33.560
He'll just play dumb and let it slide.

09:34.040 --> 09:36.000
It doesn't matter. Just take it as doing a good deed.

09:36.030 --> 09:37.620
What would you like to eat? It's my treat.

09:52.900 --> 09:54.080
What are you thinking about?

09:56.630 --> 09:57.310
Nothing.

09:59.720 --> 10:00.890
Worried about Fenghua?

10:08.890 --> 10:10.930
She always shares the good news but never the bad.

10:12.340 --> 10:13.760
This is the first time she's surrendered

10:14.020 --> 10:15.010
and said she's tired.

10:18.740 --> 10:20.740
How much pressure can there be in the express delivery industry?

10:21.910 --> 10:22.850
If she can't handle it,

10:22.870 --> 10:24.390
she should just reduce the delivery areas.

10:25.680 --> 10:27.610
Fenghua has quite a few people working under her.

10:27.650 --> 10:28.890
If she can't afford to pay them, she should fire them.

10:29.290 --> 10:32.170
She's running an express delivery business, not a charity.

10:32.540 --> 10:33.550
She's soft-hearted.

10:33.750 --> 10:34.690
She likes to take on everything.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.790
She spoils all her subordinates.

10:36.840 --> 10:37.840
Everyone says she's nice.

10:37.880 --> 10:39.470
She bears all the pressure alone.

10:39.490 --> 10:40.780
This can't go on forever.

10:42.150 --> 10:43.760
If she wants to bear it, let her.

10:43.780 --> 10:44.910
When she can't handle it anymore,

10:44.910 --> 10:45.950
she'll naturally let it go.

10:47.360 --> 10:48.950
When that time comes, we'll help her

10:48.990 --> 10:50.070
with whatever she needs.

10:50.240 --> 10:52.110
We'll make sure she doesn't suffer or go poor.

10:52.130 --> 10:53.730
But she's feeling wronged right now.

10:55.600 --> 10:57.070
That's her own doing.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.440
When I went to Bee,

10:59.470 --> 11:00.820
I wanted her to come with me.

11:01.060 --> 11:02.700
The salary would have been much higher than now.

11:02.730 --> 11:03.510
With me there,

11:03.570 --> 11:05.180
I could have taken care of her if anything happened.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.490
She absolutely refused to do it.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.150
Why?

11:07.150 --> 11:08.820
Because she couldn't let go of those employees.

11:10.340 --> 11:11.210
And what happened?

11:11.390 --> 11:13.820
Other companies offered 300 yuan more per month,

11:14.030 --> 11:16.390
and those people left without a second thought.

11:17.050 --> 11:18.420
Fenghua got wasted

11:18.840 --> 11:20.960
and came to my doorstep at night, sobbing,

11:21.160 --> 11:22.670
asking me how much she was worth.

11:23.130 --> 11:25.330
Why was 300 yuan was enough to betray her?

11:25.360 --> 11:26.610
What could I have said?

11:27.760 --> 11:28.780
It was her own fault?

11:37.700 --> 11:39.680
♫When I need someone the most♫

11:40.270 --> 11:42.780
♫Gently pat on my shoulder♫

11:43.310 --> 11:45.440
♫Who is willing to share with me♫

11:46.190 --> 11:48.040
♫In their happiest moments?♫

11:49.010 --> 11:50.880
♫Life is long♫

11:51.590 --> 11:53.780
♫I'm by your side♫

11:54.730 --> 11:55.850
♫Witnessing your growth♫

11:56.330 --> 11:59.590
♫Gives me strength♫

11:56.710 --> 11:57.550
Hello?

11:57.910 --> 11:58.580
What are you doing?

12:00.120 --> 12:01.310
♫Who can forget the past?♫

12:00.210 --> 12:01.200
On a date.

12:01.250 --> 12:02.090
A date?

12:02.170 --> 12:05.190
♫I've been with you all the way♫

12:02.940 --> 12:04.270
Is there someone in your room?

12:05.790 --> 12:07.380
♫Who can predict the future?♫

12:07.830 --> 12:08.390
Fine.

12:07.920 --> 12:10.870
♫Long and far, where are you?♫

12:08.890 --> 12:09.470
I'm leaving.

12:13.860 --> 12:14.590
Where are you going?

12:25.690 --> 12:27.010
I've figured it out.

12:27.040 --> 12:29.510
You're the biggest obstacle in my weight loss journey.

12:29.540 --> 12:30.470
You've always been.

12:30.490 --> 12:31.300
Fine.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.090
Don't eat it.

12:33.120 --> 12:33.930
I'll eat it.

12:35.310 --> 12:36.960
Hand it over.

12:37.370 --> 12:38.070
Go away.

12:43.540 --> 12:44.700
You're not mad at me, are you?

12:45.200 --> 12:45.960
I am.

12:47.010 --> 12:48.290
You're pregnant?

12:48.770 --> 12:50.490
How long has it been? How many months?

12:52.680 --> 12:53.950
It's burning my eyes.

12:54.200 --> 12:55.750
Serves you right for making me angry.

12:55.780 --> 12:56.660
Get me some tissues.

13:01.920 --> 13:03.460
Actually, I'm quite happy for you.

13:05.370 --> 13:06.260
What are you happy about?

13:06.280 --> 13:08.210
At least you've settled down

13:08.240 --> 13:10.050
and are willing to do some proper work.

13:10.270 --> 13:12.090
We were all worried about you before.

13:15.840 --> 13:18.920
Xie Wanghe begged me.

13:19.060 --> 13:20.890
I had to give him some respect, at least.

13:21.430 --> 13:23.000
I begged you too.

13:23.030 --> 13:24.470
But you didn't give me respect.

13:33.210 --> 13:34.900
Wanghe is indeed having a tough time now.

13:34.920 --> 13:36.000
He's under a lot of pressure.

13:36.890 --> 13:38.520
Now, everyone in the company

13:38.560 --> 13:39.800
is waiting for him to fail.

13:40.540 --> 13:41.900
I went over with Haikuo

13:42.340 --> 13:43.270
to help him.

13:45.140 --> 13:46.360
Once we get through this busy period,

13:47.030 --> 13:48.410
and overcome this hurdle,

13:48.820 --> 13:50.180
the road ahead will be smoother.

13:56.800 --> 13:58.030
Don't be mad at me.

13:59.030 --> 14:01.250
As soon as I finish canvassing the east street,

14:01.270 --> 14:02.470
I'll come help you when I have time.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.080
No need.

14:06.400 --> 14:08.130
I'm not really tired,

14:08.260 --> 14:09.290
just anxious.

14:10.030 --> 14:10.740
What are you anxious about?

14:12.550 --> 14:14.470
Food delivery is booming right now.

14:14.640 --> 14:16.180
They're pouring money into recruitment.

14:16.240 --> 14:17.910
I'm afraid I'll wake up one day

14:18.050 --> 14:19.050
and all my employees will be gone.

14:23.410 --> 14:24.670
Let them go.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.090
You can't keep the ones you want to stay.

14:26.320 --> 14:27.470
You can't force away the ones you want to leave.

14:27.890 --> 14:28.660
Just let it be.

14:33.110 --> 14:34.680
Keep an eye on Wanghe.

14:34.790 --> 14:36.190
Don't let him do anything reckless.

14:36.240 --> 14:37.670
He's the type who's willing to do anything

14:37.700 --> 14:38.980
for the sake of performance.

14:39.610 --> 14:41.640
When he was doing ground promotions with Haikuo before,

14:41.660 --> 14:43.980
he dared to climb over the wall into a school in broad daylight.

14:44.020 --> 14:45.900
He almost fell to his death when the security guards chased him.

14:50.560 --> 14:52.570
If you have time to worry about others,

14:52.880 --> 14:56.170
why don't you take good care of yourself instead?

14:56.580 --> 14:57.740
I'm doing fine.

14:57.850 --> 14:58.730
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.790
Then don't get upset in the future,

15:01.830 --> 15:04.380
and complain after getting drunk at midnight.

15:07.900 --> 15:09.620
You talk so much every day.

15:17.040 --> 15:18.340
I'll do it myself.

15:24.250 --> 15:25.250
You're full?

15:34.860 --> 15:38.290
[Fenghua Express]

15:44.500 --> 15:45.950
You turned smart today.

15:45.960 --> 15:47.340
You even remembered to lock it.

15:47.550 --> 15:48.100
[Fenghua Express]

15:49.190 --> 15:50.850
It's okay, you go up and deliver it.

15:50.950 --> 15:51.870
I'll watch it for you.

15:51.910 --> 15:53.590
Really. You can go.

15:57.700 --> 15:58.830
The packages are all here.

15:59.280 --> 16:00.520
I dare you to touch it.

16:04.580 --> 16:05.900
I touched it.

16:05.920 --> 16:06.820
So what?

16:06.860 --> 16:08.090
You gonna bite me?

16:09.140 --> 16:11.010
Don't be shameless when I'm being nice.

16:11.040 --> 16:13.090
What if I am shameless?

16:13.680 --> 16:14.720
Being shameless, huh?

16:14.750 --> 16:15.770
Being shameless, huh?

16:15.860 --> 16:16.630
Come on.

16:32.960 --> 16:33.980
Are you hurt?

16:35.420 --> 16:36.180
No.

16:36.630 --> 16:37.690
Where are they?

16:38.050 --> 16:39.280
They're inside.

16:39.480 --> 16:40.570
I didn't fight.

16:41.250 --> 16:42.400
That's progress.

16:43.210 --> 16:44.640
He threw my packages.

16:44.660 --> 16:46.170
They're all fragile items inside.

16:46.390 --> 16:47.460
They must compensate for that.

16:47.480 --> 16:48.240
We will.

16:49.260 --> 16:52.220
We were in the wrong this time.

16:52.640 --> 16:54.370
We'll compensate for whatever is damaged.

17:07.119 --> 17:08.170
Come, sit down.

17:08.230 --> 17:08.839
Why are you standing?

17:08.859 --> 17:10.300
Have a seat. Have some water.

17:09.150 --> 17:12.589
[Shuntong Express]

17:10.329 --> 17:11.250
Thank you.

17:11.910 --> 17:12.800
No need.

17:12.819 --> 17:14.859
I should be thanking you.

17:14.890 --> 17:16.380
About that incident last time,

17:16.730 --> 17:18.960
if you hadn't been there,

17:19.160 --> 17:22.980
I would've been in big trouble if I'd lost that package.

17:23.859 --> 17:25.460
You should advise them in the future

17:25.480 --> 17:27.290
to always wear helmets when riding.

17:27.329 --> 17:28.700
I've already told them.

17:28.730 --> 17:29.910
And I've made it a rule.

17:29.910 --> 17:31.510
If you don't wear a helmet, you'll be fined.

17:31.530 --> 17:32.640
They think it's too hot.

17:32.710 --> 17:33.850
Well...

17:34.470 --> 17:36.490
Did you buy insurance for them?

17:36.550 --> 17:37.510
Yes, I did.

17:37.550 --> 17:39.620
Three yuan a day for accident insurance.

17:40.020 --> 17:41.140
Three yuan?

17:41.170 --> 17:42.320
That's not enough.

17:47.070 --> 17:49.610
I won't worry about your company's affairs.

17:50.550 --> 17:51.340
How about

17:51.360 --> 17:52.520
we talk about business?

17:52.620 --> 17:53.980
Rather than vicious competition,

17:54.010 --> 17:55.350
it's better to cooperate for mutual benefit.

17:55.370 --> 17:56.690
How do you want to cooperate?

17:56.960 --> 17:58.830
I'll take the east side, you take the west.

17:58.850 --> 18:00.020
We each do our own thing.

18:00.240 --> 18:02.870
The Keyuan Nanli community in the middle has the highest volume of deliveries.

18:02.900 --> 18:04.370
We can work together there

18:04.390 --> 18:05.470
and split the profits proportionally.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.760
We won't take advantage of you.

18:08.130 --> 18:09.040
A 40-60 split.

18:11.680 --> 18:13.440
Our two companies can cover this entire area.

18:13.510 --> 18:14.950
Other big companies won't be able to get in.

18:16.790 --> 18:17.750
30-70 split.

18:18.720 --> 18:20.150
Look, I have so many people.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.110
The pressure is high.

18:25.430 --> 18:26.220
Alright.

18:26.330 --> 18:27.330
Then 30-70 it is.

18:29.220 --> 18:30.290
It's a pleasure doing business with you.

18:30.360 --> 18:31.260
Please take care of us.

18:32.320 --> 18:32.660
[Shelf 04]

18:40.600 --> 18:44.030
[EV charging is prohibited in the workshop and warehouse]

18:42.080 --> 18:43.300
You scared me.

18:44.110 --> 18:48.250
[No smoking]

18:45.200 --> 18:46.220
It was going so well.

18:46.310 --> 18:47.270
Why did you bring up insurance?

18:47.690 --> 18:48.920
You said three yuan wasn't enough.

18:49.060 --> 18:50.340
Mr. Wei almost lost his temper.

18:50.640 --> 18:51.770
It really isn't enough.

18:51.430 --> 18:58.470
[Be careful of fire]

18:51.820 --> 18:52.790
How much can insurance

18:52.790 --> 18:54.830
for three yuan a day pay if an accident happens?

18:56.290 --> 18:56.900
Fenghua,

18:57.210 --> 18:58.730
the wool comes from the sheep's back.

18:58.470 --> 19:02.420
[Shuntong Express]

18:58.750 --> 19:00.280
Rather than spending money on peace of mind,

19:00.510 --> 19:02.120
it's better to increase everyone's commission.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.730
That's narrow-minded.

19:04.950 --> 19:06.030
Everyone thinks that way.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.070
Really.

19:13.720 --> 19:15.040
He is back.

19:15.590 --> 19:17.270
Mr. He, how was the talk?

19:15.620 --> 19:20.800
[Fenghua Express]

19:18.400 --> 19:19.790
How did it go?

19:19.820 --> 19:20.970
You're all eating?

19:21.310 --> 19:22.300
-Sister Hua.
-Sister Hua.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.220
-Sister Hua.
-Sister Hua.

19:23.300 --> 19:25.560
First, I have some good news for everyone.

19:25.710 --> 19:26.970
I've already communicated

19:27.090 --> 19:28.770
with Mr. Wei from Shuntong.

19:28.790 --> 19:30.330
From now on, we'll work together

19:30.350 --> 19:31.600
in Keyuan Nanli.

19:31.630 --> 19:32.870
There won't be any more business disputes.

19:32.910 --> 19:34.870
Great!

19:34.900 --> 19:37.390
There's one more thing I want to discuss with everyone.

19:37.590 --> 19:39.860
Okay, go ahead. Tell us.

19:39.890 --> 19:42.020
I've tried to get insurance.

19:42.190 --> 19:43.580
The headquarters said there's no such plan,

19:43.770 --> 19:47.120
so I hope everyone can work together.

19:47.150 --> 19:48.070
I'll pay half,

19:48.090 --> 19:49.290
and everyone pays the other half.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.920
Let's buy the basic five insurances and one housing fund.

19:57.170 --> 19:58.170
I know

19:58.830 --> 20:00.680
everyone is reluctant to spend this money.

20:00.700 --> 20:01.540
You think it's useless.

20:01.540 --> 20:02.880
It really is useless.

20:02.900 --> 20:04.750
We came to Beijing to make money.

20:04.780 --> 20:05.980
We can't stay here anyway.

20:06.320 --> 20:07.120
Once we've earned enough money,

20:07.150 --> 20:08.800
most of us still have to go back home, right?

20:08.830 --> 20:10.180
Yes, indeed.

20:10.400 --> 20:11.520
It's the same for me.

20:11.550 --> 20:13.750
I came to Beijing right after graduating from high school.

20:13.780 --> 20:14.990
Over these six or seven years,

20:15.020 --> 20:16.810
I've changed countless jobs.

20:16.920 --> 20:17.920
Why is that?

20:18.110 --> 20:20.060
I just felt unsettled inside.

20:20.090 --> 20:21.210
I didn't have a sense of belonging.

20:21.230 --> 20:22.400
So I hope

20:22.420 --> 20:23.940
we can all work together

20:23.970 --> 20:25.310
to get the insurances

20:25.350 --> 20:26.110
and make our place

20:26.130 --> 20:28.330
a home we can rely on.

20:42.750 --> 20:43.460
It's okay.

20:44.550 --> 20:45.850
Think about it some more.

20:46.280 --> 20:47.800
I'm not forcing the insurance issue.

20:47.820 --> 20:50.230
Those who want it can fill out the application form.

20:50.250 --> 20:51.330
You all eat up.

20:55.760 --> 20:58.870
Mr. Wang, these couriers are out doing deliveries all day.

20:58.910 --> 21:00.850
What if an accident happens one day?

21:01.230 --> 21:02.150
Currently, we're

21:02.150 --> 21:04.110
deducting money from their wages to buy accident insurance.

21:04.420 --> 21:06.620
But precisely because it's their own money being deducted,

21:06.640 --> 21:08.220
they don't want to buy it.

21:08.790 --> 21:10.110
So, I was thinking,

21:10.130 --> 21:11.330
if I cover half

21:11.360 --> 21:12.670
and the company covers the other half,

21:12.700 --> 21:14.810
they won't have to pay for it.

21:14.850 --> 21:15.530
What are you thinking?

21:17.460 --> 21:19.310
How many employees do we have in our company?

21:19.520 --> 21:20.840
If I cover half for them,

21:20.860 --> 21:22.370
half for all the people, in our company,

21:22.390 --> 21:23.200
how will we survive?

21:23.900 --> 21:25.600
You're trying to bankrupt the company, aren't you?

21:25.760 --> 21:26.630
Let me tell you,

21:26.660 --> 21:28.630
this method you're suggesting is absolutely impossible.

21:29.480 --> 21:30.310
Alright.

21:30.540 --> 21:31.330
I understand.

21:31.520 --> 21:32.760
Let's leave it at that for now.

21:50.350 --> 21:54.200
[Data Center]

21:54.200 --> 22:02.820
[Send] [Take]

21:56.700 --> 21:57.550
Does it feel good to see?

21:58.900 --> 21:59.700
It's okay.

22:01.860 --> 22:03.010
Just keep pretending.

22:03.370 --> 22:04.370
Really.

22:05.030 --> 22:06.700
It's just a few kilometers of territory.

22:07.370 --> 22:09.070
They couldn't handle it before

22:09.240 --> 22:10.240
because they were incompetent.

22:10.680 --> 22:11.600
I'm complimenting you.

22:11.770 --> 22:13.210
Don't give others a hard time.

22:13.390 --> 22:15.330
I'm not giving anyone a hard time.

22:15.700 --> 22:17.160
I'm just being practical.

22:19.520 --> 22:20.650
Prioritize the bigger picture.

22:26.510 --> 22:27.530
You did well this time.

22:27.570 --> 22:28.450
You didn't embarrass me.

22:29.900 --> 22:30.870
Don't just say it.

22:31.280 --> 22:33.970
How about contributing that bottle of Fenjiu?

22:33.990 --> 22:35.260
You're not drinking it anyway.

22:35.670 --> 22:36.460
Liquor?

22:36.630 --> 22:37.340
Take it if you want.

22:38.920 --> 22:39.830
This is for you too.

22:42.810 --> 22:43.690
Really giving it to me?

22:43.700 --> 22:45.290
This is just the beginning.

22:45.910 --> 22:47.960
If you help me secure Haidian District,

22:48.040 --> 22:49.110
I have a big reward for you later.

22:54.120 --> 22:55.420
Wait for my good news.

23:35.540 --> 23:36.520
This month,

23:35.630 --> 23:41.630
[Service Counter]

23:37.310 --> 23:38.850
everyone has done a great job.

23:39.450 --> 23:41.850
Our order volume has repeatedly hit new highs.

23:41.880 --> 23:44.080
Under Mr. Xie's leadership,

23:44.210 --> 23:47.260
you've created miracles for Bee.

23:47.740 --> 23:49.110
Mr. Xie's rule is

23:49.750 --> 23:51.110
clear rewards and punishments.

23:51.550 --> 23:53.290
It has proven to be effective.

23:54.610 --> 23:55.780
I've thought about it

23:56.390 --> 23:58.460
and decided that next week's commission

23:58.870 --> 23:59.980
will be doubled!

24:03.030 --> 24:05.950
Mr. Xie!

24:05.970 --> 24:08.760
Mr. Xie!

24:08.780 --> 24:11.640
Mr. Xie!

24:11.670 --> 24:14.440
Mr. Xie!

24:14.460 --> 24:17.140
Mr. Xie!

24:25.680 --> 24:27.250
What's wrong with you?

24:27.430 --> 24:29.310
Are things not going well at work?

24:33.890 --> 24:35.800
A few more employees jumped ship today

24:36.370 --> 24:37.340
to Bee.

24:38.070 --> 24:39.190
Why?

24:39.800 --> 24:41.100
It pays better than this.

24:46.030 --> 24:47.460
You can't leave.

24:48.690 --> 24:50.640
Ms. Xia has been good to our family.

24:50.810 --> 24:52.250
As long as she's here,

24:54.030 --> 24:55.280
we can't leave.

24:55.530 --> 24:56.300
Got it?

24:59.500 --> 25:00.850
Stop drinking.

25:02.840 --> 25:04.110
Stop drinking. You've been at it all night.

25:04.150 --> 25:05.340
I'm afraid if she still doesn't think of a way,

25:05.370 --> 25:06.410
we'll have to close too.

25:08.680 --> 25:09.470
When that happens,

25:11.030 --> 25:12.020
what are we going to do?

25:12.970 --> 25:14.610
Our whole family will end up living under a bridge.

25:20.270 --> 25:21.880
When I first came to Beijing,

25:22.100 --> 25:24.150
I loved seeing the lights from all the households.

25:25.090 --> 25:26.960
I thought that as long as I worked hard,

25:27.260 --> 25:28.630
one day,

25:28.860 --> 25:30.270
I could have

25:30.350 --> 25:32.000
my own home here too.

25:35.790 --> 25:36.850
But

25:37.310 --> 25:39.150
after working hard all these years,

25:39.780 --> 25:40.700
I realized that

25:40.710 --> 25:43.520
in this place that seems to have infinite possibilities,

25:44.180 --> 25:46.660
everyone is being held hostage

25:46.680 --> 25:48.400
by cruel competition.

25:51.750 --> 25:52.870
As for me,

25:54.130 --> 25:56.360
I'm just an insignificant person.

25:57.340 --> 25:59.280
I can't change anything.

26:12.770 --> 26:13.560
Wanghe.

26:13.600 --> 26:14.270
Mr. Meng.

26:14.270 --> 26:16.750
I've brought you the liquor you wanted.

26:16.860 --> 26:18.220
You're really willing to give it to me?

26:18.250 --> 26:19.140
What are you talking about?

26:19.170 --> 26:20.320
I've even given you the car.

26:20.350 --> 26:21.720
A bottle of liquor is nothing.

26:22.110 --> 26:22.860
From now on,

26:23.200 --> 26:25.180
just take whatever you like.

26:25.410 --> 26:26.680
As long as you all can help me

26:26.680 --> 26:28.730
completely take over Haidian District,

26:28.770 --> 26:29.740
I'll even drive you all

26:29.740 --> 26:31.330
to and from work every day if you want.

26:31.960 --> 26:32.710
I wouldn't dare.

26:33.310 --> 26:34.550
Then let's wait

26:35.150 --> 26:36.640
until we've completely taken over Haidian

26:36.670 --> 26:37.720
and drink this at the celebration party.

26:37.740 --> 26:38.510
Alright.

26:40.140 --> 26:41.430
Let me formally introduce you all.

26:42.300 --> 26:43.150
Zhou Haikuo.

26:43.180 --> 26:44.370
Shao Xingchi.

26:44.410 --> 26:45.070
Hello.

26:45.090 --> 26:45.620
Mr. Meng.

26:46.730 --> 26:47.340
Hello.

26:48.030 --> 26:48.800
Hello.

26:49.460 --> 26:52.060
The three of us grew up together since we were babies

26:52.100 --> 26:52.820
in the same courtyard.

26:54.120 --> 26:55.480
Then I must toast to you all.

26:55.750 --> 26:58.200
One hero needs three helpers, right?

26:58.230 --> 26:58.870
Come.

27:03.590 --> 27:05.610
Resigning is not a small matter.

27:06.130 --> 27:07.480
Have you really thought it through?

27:10.270 --> 27:11.820
Although Bee is on a roll,

27:11.840 --> 27:14.000
the food delivery industry is so competitive.

27:14.040 --> 27:16.700
I think it's hard to say if they can even survive.

27:17.950 --> 27:19.690
But I'm happy doing it.

27:20.890 --> 27:21.670
How should I put it?

27:21.710 --> 27:22.870
It feels like

27:23.290 --> 27:25.150
as soon as I open my eyes every day, I really want to work.

27:25.180 --> 27:26.970
I just want to keep charging forward.

27:27.090 --> 27:27.890
And working under Wanghe,

27:27.910 --> 27:29.060
I feel like there's something to look forward to.

27:29.990 --> 27:32.450
Wanghe really has charisma.

27:32.490 --> 27:34.690
You all just do whatever he says.

27:35.430 --> 27:36.950
What, are you jealous?

27:36.960 --> 27:39.610
I just think he's really good at sweet-talking people.

27:39.650 --> 27:41.390
It's like he's on a constant adrenaline rush.

27:41.510 --> 27:44.160
People like him should do sales.

27:44.360 --> 27:45.820
You know what?

27:46.100 --> 27:48.870
if he did sales, he'd definitely get rich.

27:48.990 --> 27:50.560
When we were in high school,

27:50.590 --> 27:52.870
he even had our homeroom teacher and the principal

27:52.900 --> 27:54.670
under his thumb.

27:55.140 --> 27:59.130
He set up a test prep center and caused chaos.

27:59.260 --> 28:01.920
He had endless energy back then.

28:04.880 --> 28:06.980
Childhood friendships are precious,

28:07.410 --> 28:10.390
but after growing up, you still have to rely on yourself.

28:10.660 --> 28:12.610
Then I'll just refuse to grow up.

28:16.880 --> 28:20.570
Friends walk together for life.

28:20.590 --> 28:24.540
Those days won't come again.

28:24.560 --> 28:28.610
One promise for a lifetime.

28:28.640 --> 28:30.590
One lifetime of friendship.

28:30.620 --> 28:34.780
One cup of liquor.

28:35.160 --> 28:36.090
Let's drink.

28:36.290 --> 28:37.500
Cheers!

28:37.780 --> 28:39.710
Come on, come on.

28:37.940 --> 28:39.540
[A lifetime of friends, you'll understand]

28:39.570 --> 28:41.340
[You'll get hurt and feel pain]

28:41.340 --> 28:42.550
[You still have to go, you'll still have me]

28:45.430 --> 28:46.440
Fenghua,

28:46.770 --> 28:48.740
after they arrived,

28:48.990 --> 28:50.710
things have been smooth for us.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.660
We're going to take over

28:52.700 --> 28:54.280
Haidian District soon.

28:55.470 --> 28:57.650
If you want to join now, it's not too late.

28:58.750 --> 29:00.950
Is this why you called me here?

29:02.060 --> 29:04.260
Celebrating our success is priority.

29:04.960 --> 29:06.720
Poaching you is second.

29:08.060 --> 29:09.130
I know

29:09.360 --> 29:11.540
you can't let go of your employees.

29:11.570 --> 29:13.540
Fenghua, if you're willing to come,

29:13.570 --> 29:15.450
I'll take all your employees.

29:16.480 --> 29:17.490
To do what?

29:17.700 --> 29:19.030
To do food delivery.

29:19.060 --> 29:20.140
What else?

29:21.530 --> 29:23.800
I trust the people you've trained.

29:24.330 --> 29:25.460
I'm telling you,

29:26.510 --> 29:28.380
the income from food delivery

29:28.390 --> 29:31.110
will definitely be much higher than express delivery.

29:31.350 --> 29:32.120
It's a win-win.

29:34.800 --> 29:36.310
What if I refuse?

29:36.340 --> 29:37.760
Why would you refuse?

29:37.800 --> 29:39.310
I'm not interested. Is that okay?

29:39.340 --> 29:41.190
Why aren't you interested?

29:46.470 --> 29:47.880
Alright, alright.

29:48.220 --> 29:50.490
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

29:51.740 --> 29:54.650
If you really don't want to come, I can't force you.

29:54.710 --> 29:57.000
But you should at least tell me your actual situation.

29:57.030 --> 29:57.920
Why?

29:59.770 --> 30:02.100
I came here today for entertainment,

30:02.160 --> 30:03.850
but you insist on talking business.

30:08.780 --> 30:10.050
Okay, let's not talk about it.

30:10.600 --> 30:11.930
Let's sing and drink.

30:55.950 --> 30:57.100
What are you doing?

30:57.810 --> 30:59.090
Are you stealing oil?

31:00.590 --> 31:01.480
Stop!

31:01.850 --> 31:03.230
How dare you steal oil?

31:04.220 --> 31:05.060
Stop!

31:05.080 --> 31:06.500
Stop!

31:07.310 --> 31:08.740
How dare you steal oil?

31:08.760 --> 31:10.180
You dare to steal oil?

31:12.320 --> 31:13.360
Boss!

31:13.380 --> 31:14.750
You dare to steal oil!

31:17.830 --> 31:19.390
Go, go, go!

31:22.150 --> 31:23.060
Little rascals!

31:23.080 --> 31:24.060
Stealing oil?

31:33.540 --> 31:35.800
Boss, what's wrong?

31:36.730 --> 31:37.800
I was too careless.

31:38.680 --> 31:39.890
Help!

31:40.460 --> 31:41.750
Help!

31:41.780 --> 31:42.770
Help!

31:43.390 --> 31:45.520
Someone, help!

31:53.890 --> 31:54.610
Mom?

31:58.550 --> 31:59.570
Is he okay?

32:01.070 --> 32:02.110
Okay, okay, I got it.

32:02.150 --> 32:02.950
I'll be right there.

32:03.540 --> 32:04.100
What happened?

32:04.120 --> 32:05.940
My dad was stabbed while driving long-distance.

32:05.970 --> 32:07.290
He's in emergency care at Tianjin Hospital now.

32:07.310 --> 32:08.310
I need to get there quickly.

32:11.170 --> 32:12.340
You've been drinking. How can you drive?

32:12.370 --> 32:13.090
Substitute driver.

32:13.110 --> 32:13.950
What?

32:13.980 --> 32:15.170
Give me the car key.

32:16.800 --> 32:18.050
You can't go.

32:18.420 --> 32:19.700
You and Haikuo need to stay here.

32:19.730 --> 32:20.850
It's a critical moment now.

32:20.880 --> 32:22.150
We need to watch out for Qiu Lin and Mr. Song.

32:22.170 --> 32:23.370
They might cause trouble.

32:23.410 --> 32:24.030
Where are you going?

32:24.060 --> 32:25.140
I have an emergency.

32:25.170 --> 32:25.820
I'm sorry.

32:25.840 --> 32:27.030
Let's meet again next time.

32:29.070 --> 32:30.300
You two, be safe.

32:30.340 --> 32:31.370
Drive carefully!

32:38.060 --> 32:39.910
My dad, I swear,

32:40.470 --> 32:42.660
he still gets so worked up over nothing at his age.

32:42.680 --> 32:43.770
I can't stand him.

32:45.330 --> 32:47.370
When you see him, watch your language, okay?

32:47.400 --> 32:48.900
Don't start arguing again.

32:49.110 --> 32:52.090
If he's the one causing trouble, can't I say something?

32:52.530 --> 32:53.880
When people get old,

32:53.910 --> 32:54.990
they're like children again.

32:55.010 --> 32:56.300
They get agitated when you scold them.

32:56.960 --> 32:58.810
Why isn't Grandpa Zhou like that?

32:59.390 --> 33:01.040
He's always so gentle and mild-mannered.

33:01.080 --> 33:02.540
Your dad has a good temper too.

33:02.580 --> 33:04.390
I've never seen him talk back.

33:04.720 --> 33:06.130
My dad does talk back.

33:06.310 --> 33:08.580
He just mutters it so others can't hear it.

33:12.540 --> 33:13.440
I think

33:14.180 --> 33:15.680
I should take this opportunity

33:16.300 --> 33:17.340
to get them both to stop working

33:17.360 --> 33:18.320
and retire soon.

33:18.830 --> 33:20.300
Why should they retire?

33:20.320 --> 33:22.940
I'm capable of supporting them now.

33:22.970 --> 33:25.390
They'll be happy that you're making money,

33:25.420 --> 33:28.430
but their generation really can't stand being idle.

33:28.680 --> 33:31.340
It's even more impossible for them to be comfortable spending their children's money.

33:31.370 --> 33:32.260
Why?

33:32.300 --> 33:34.700
Their joy comes from showing off.

33:34.820 --> 33:37.180
The more successful their children are, the happier they are.

33:37.200 --> 33:38.240
A couple of years ago,

33:39.100 --> 33:40.690
my mom used to complain to me.

33:41.380 --> 33:42.270
She said,

33:42.440 --> 33:44.910
"When will I be able to enjoy the fruits of your success?"

33:44.940 --> 33:47.320
Later, when I made some money and bought her jewelry,

33:47.360 --> 33:49.670
she yelled my ear off.

33:49.690 --> 33:52.470
She said, "You should've saved this money for your dowry.

33:52.500 --> 33:54.050
Your father and I are still young.

33:54.090 --> 33:55.440
You don't need to worry about us."

33:56.450 --> 33:57.770
How old are they?

33:57.810 --> 33:58.840
Still young, huh?

34:00.050 --> 34:03.510
It's precisely because they've reached this age that they can't admit to being old.

34:03.860 --> 34:06.220
Otherwise, they'd really be old.

34:18.440 --> 34:19.620
Let's go a bit faster.

34:37.460 --> 34:38.139
Mom.

34:38.159 --> 34:38.810
Mom.

34:39.540 --> 34:40.530
Aunt Liang.

34:40.590 --> 34:41.940
You two came together?

34:41.969 --> 34:42.940
Well, I had some drinks,

34:42.969 --> 34:43.820
so I couldn't drive.

34:43.840 --> 34:44.870
How's my dad?

34:44.900 --> 34:47.270
Don't worry, the doctor said he's fine now.

34:47.290 --> 34:48.719
He got a dozen stitches on his stomach.

34:48.760 --> 34:49.989
What happened?

34:50.600 --> 34:51.810
Someone was stealing oil.

34:51.840 --> 34:53.120
Your dad acted like the Good Samaritan

34:53.159 --> 34:54.880
and pushed the thieves too far.

34:55.480 --> 34:56.219
It's okay now.

34:56.250 --> 34:57.690
The doctor said he was treated in time.

34:56.810 --> 35:01.670
[Tianjin City People's Hospital]

34:58.000 --> 35:01.080
He can be discharged after a few days of rest.

35:01.860 --> 35:02.750
Don't worry.

35:03.110 --> 35:04.110
Which ward?

35:04.970 --> 35:06.500
Bed 28. He's asleep.

35:07.820 --> 35:08.540
I'll go check on him.

35:08.340 --> 35:10.720
[Facts About Infectious Diseases]

35:44.880 --> 35:46.670
In the blink of an eye,

35:48.390 --> 35:49.770
you've grown into a young lady.

35:52.950 --> 35:55.590
You shouldn't just focus on your career.

35:56.190 --> 35:59.630
At your age, you should be looking for a man.

36:01.230 --> 36:04.690
Pressuring for marriage is a traditional New Year activity.

36:04.710 --> 36:06.380
It's not New Year yet.

36:09.790 --> 36:10.910
I have a son,

36:10.950 --> 36:12.310
so I'm not in a hurry.

36:12.350 --> 36:14.230
Your father

36:14.270 --> 36:16.130
always has his ears perked.

36:16.150 --> 36:17.680
With the information he's researched,

36:17.700 --> 36:19.460
he could change careers and open a matchmaking agency.

36:20.600 --> 36:21.360
Yes.

36:22.280 --> 36:23.140
Fenghua,

36:23.890 --> 36:25.360
you need to

36:25.390 --> 36:27.790
keep an eye on Wanghe for me.

36:27.810 --> 36:29.500
Don't let him mess around.

36:30.270 --> 36:32.940
Don't worry, he's doing quite well.

36:32.980 --> 36:35.300
Xingchi and Haikuo are both working for him now.

36:35.450 --> 36:36.810
He even tried to poach me.

36:36.830 --> 36:37.970
I firmly refused.

36:39.100 --> 36:40.050
Why?

36:41.070 --> 36:42.880
If you have any concerns, tell me.

36:42.900 --> 36:44.220
I'll go scold him later.

36:44.820 --> 36:45.830
I'm not concerned.

36:46.780 --> 36:48.030
I'm doing fine on my own.

36:48.060 --> 36:49.650
Why should I work for him?

36:49.800 --> 36:51.440
I can't be bothered to listen to his nonsense.

36:57.080 --> 36:58.480
You little girl.

36:58.660 --> 37:02.800
[Monopoly]

37:08.020 --> 37:11.310
I'll build another house

37:12.030 --> 37:13.130
and put it here.

37:14.150 --> 37:16.640
I've connected all these, haven't I?

37:17.410 --> 37:19.920
You just said you guys also poached Fenghua.

37:20.020 --> 37:21.100
Yes, that's right.

37:21.120 --> 37:23.130
Wanghe has always wanted Fenghua to come.

37:23.190 --> 37:24.100
Fenghua refuses.

37:25.000 --> 37:26.670
Why? Is it because the pay is too low?

37:26.910 --> 37:28.240
It's not about the money.

37:28.260 --> 37:29.550
Then it's about feelings?

37:30.170 --> 37:32.920
Actually, Fenghua didn't have to come to Beijing.

37:33.810 --> 37:36.250
If she had stayed in Flower Street doing e-commerce, she would have earned quite a bit.

37:36.740 --> 37:38.290
She's suffered a lot in Beijing

37:38.330 --> 37:39.570
and has been holding on until now.

37:39.880 --> 37:40.800
It hasn't been easy.

37:42.390 --> 37:45.470
Fenghua came to Beijing because of Wanghe?

37:46.150 --> 37:47.420
Besides this,

37:47.460 --> 37:51.820
I can't think of any other reason.

37:53.700 --> 37:55.550
Then she should go to Bee even more.

37:55.590 --> 37:57.020
They could be together day and night.

37:57.050 --> 37:58.780
Wouldn't there be many more opportunities?

37:58.910 --> 38:01.610
If she came, she and Wanghe would be superior and subordinate.

38:01.650 --> 38:03.990
Wouldn't that completely ruin any chances for them?

38:05.950 --> 38:07.310
Does Wanghe know about this?

38:09.190 --> 38:11.620
He should be aware of it in his heart.

38:12.620 --> 38:13.990
No one dares to say anything.

38:14.830 --> 38:15.790
Why?

38:16.470 --> 38:18.170
If this kind of thing is said out loud,

38:18.230 --> 38:19.820
it's fine if it works out.

38:19.980 --> 38:20.800
If it doesn't,

38:22.350 --> 38:23.330
after that,

38:23.360 --> 38:24.800
they can't even be friends anymore.

38:44.150 --> 38:45.300
You're awake.

38:48.830 --> 38:50.180
When did you arrive?

38:50.440 --> 38:51.230
Last night.

38:51.470 --> 38:52.430
He drank,

38:52.460 --> 38:53.780
so I drove here.

38:55.420 --> 38:56.270
Have a seat.

39:00.470 --> 39:01.030
Dad.

39:01.170 --> 39:02.050
I'm fine, I'm fine.

39:02.070 --> 39:02.830
I'm really okay.

39:02.950 --> 39:04.800
Just a small cut on my stomach.

39:04.820 --> 39:05.550
It'll heal in a couple of days.

39:07.460 --> 39:08.770
What if it wasn't your stomach?

39:08.900 --> 39:09.990
If it had been a bit higher,

39:09.990 --> 39:11.110
would you still be alive?

39:11.400 --> 39:12.320
At your age,

39:12.350 --> 39:13.600
can't you stop causing trouble?

39:13.620 --> 39:14.850
Can't you give us a break?

39:14.880 --> 39:16.230
That's enough.

39:16.270 --> 39:17.380
You're nagging more than my mom.

39:17.400 --> 39:18.630
Is it a crime to be a Good Samaritan?

39:18.670 --> 39:19.700
He won't listen.

39:19.880 --> 39:20.870
Alright, stop talking nonsense.

39:20.900 --> 39:22.540
Come out quickly for breakfast.

39:22.590 --> 39:23.820
Why are we eating out?

39:24.010 --> 39:25.680
Your dad can only have liquid food now.

39:25.710 --> 39:26.900
Are you going to eat in front of him?

39:26.940 --> 39:27.940
That's inhumane.

39:28.370 --> 39:29.010
Let's go.

39:29.470 --> 39:31.240
Don't move. I'll be back soon.

39:33.160 --> 39:34.440
You talk too much.

39:46.450 --> 39:47.540
I've noticed.

39:48.060 --> 39:49.180
You're really sick in the head.

39:50.310 --> 39:51.430
You're the one who's sick.

39:51.960 --> 39:53.920
I told you before we came

39:54.080 --> 39:55.780
to watch your language when you see your dad.

39:56.230 --> 39:58.420
You didn't listen, and we almost had another fight just now.

39:59.570 --> 40:00.620
What's wrong with having a fight?

40:01.030 --> 40:02.220
He was reckless.

40:02.390 --> 40:03.340
Can't I say that?

40:04.950 --> 40:06.710
That's just how your dad is.

40:06.900 --> 40:09.020
He loves to meddle and stand up for others.

40:09.890 --> 40:11.150
He doesn't think he's wrong,

40:11.150 --> 40:12.430
but you insist on him admitting his mistake.

40:12.430 --> 40:13.710
Isn't that just asking for a fight?

40:14.300 --> 40:16.960
If he would listen, that'd be fine.

40:16.990 --> 40:18.390
The problem is that he can't change.

40:19.180 --> 40:20.260
Even if he can't change, he has to.

40:21.450 --> 40:22.200
Fine.

40:22.270 --> 40:23.070
Go ahead inside.

40:23.230 --> 40:24.260
You two have a fight.

40:24.280 --> 40:26.640
Beat him into submission, then force him to admit he's wrong.

40:31.430 --> 40:32.950
Is this how you're supposed to give advice?

40:36.240 --> 40:36.970
Eat.

40:37.560 --> 40:38.510
I bought it for your mom.

40:39.180 --> 40:40.060
Have you eaten already?

40:40.230 --> 40:41.060
I'm full from anger.

40:48.810 --> 40:50.210
Don't provoke me.

40:52.550 --> 40:54.550
Why didn't you bring me a bottle of water?

40:57.540 --> 40:58.360
Serves you right.

41:09.580 --> 41:11.680
The remaining few businesses have all signed as well.

41:13.170 --> 41:14.370
The task has been completed successfully.

41:14.940 --> 41:15.660
Good job.

41:17.950 --> 41:18.780
Where's Mr. Xie?

41:20.250 --> 41:21.910
He had something to attend to.

41:21.930 --> 41:22.520
He went to Tianjin.

41:22.560 --> 41:23.360
Why?

41:23.490 --> 41:25.130
We're in the middle of a fierce battle with Yuntu right now

41:25.180 --> 41:26.230
and he took time off?

41:26.300 --> 41:27.980
Does he not have any sense of organizational discipline?

41:30.050 --> 41:31.090
His father was hospitalized.

41:31.110 --> 41:32.390
So what if his father was hospitalized?

41:32.580 --> 41:33.950
Even if his father were dying right now,

41:33.980 --> 41:35.860
he couldn't just leave without saying a word.

41:35.890 --> 41:38.330
Just let us know if there's anything that needs to be done.

41:38.630 --> 41:39.620
We'll handle it.

41:40.190 --> 41:41.310
These past few days,

41:41.460 --> 41:43.700
our market share has indeed increased,

41:43.800 --> 41:46.370
but the number of orders has decreased.

41:46.630 --> 41:47.510
That's impossible.

41:47.540 --> 41:49.460
So what if you had successful street canvassing?

41:49.590 --> 41:50.440
So what

41:50.470 --> 41:51.540
if you signed agreements

41:51.560 --> 41:52.910
with all the merchants?

41:52.950 --> 41:54.560
The merchants aren't placing orders now.

41:54.590 --> 41:55.660
What can you two do about it?

41:55.910 --> 41:57.390
Why aren't they placing orders?

41:57.790 --> 41:59.330
Yuntu has increased their subsidies.

41:59.890 --> 42:01.670
They're subsidizing an average of three yuan per order.

42:02.110 --> 42:03.090
They're crazy.

42:03.810 --> 42:05.000
How long can they keep burning money like this?

42:05.020 --> 42:06.220
That's why I've been telling you all along

42:06.260 --> 42:07.460
to quickly apply to headquarters

42:07.490 --> 42:08.890
for us to increase our subsidies as well.

42:11.600 --> 42:13.480
Mr. Xie won't agree to that.

42:13.510 --> 42:14.190
For him to disagree,

42:14.190 --> 42:15.470
he has to be here, right?

42:15.650 --> 42:17.190
We can't just stand by and watch

42:17.190 --> 42:19.070
as Yuntu takes our territories one by one,

42:19.090 --> 42:20.700
without even the strength to fight back.

42:21.110 --> 42:21.990
Isn't that embarrassing?

42:22.620 --> 42:24.670
What will the entire industry think of us?

42:25.260 --> 42:25.740
Alright.

42:26.500 --> 42:27.440
How about this?

42:28.040 --> 42:29.270
Let's put the subsidy issue

42:29.350 --> 42:30.540
on hold for now.

42:30.570 --> 42:32.160
Let's do what we can.

42:32.270 --> 42:34.220
Continue to optimize the delivery process,

42:34.250 --> 42:36.040
and further reduce the delivery time.

42:36.870 --> 42:38.000
Further reduce it?

42:38.020 --> 42:38.550
We're already at the limit.

42:38.550 --> 42:39.630
Leave it to us.

42:40.330 --> 42:41.020
We'll figure something out.

42:42.480 --> 42:43.880
We'll give our all for the company.

42:45.750 --> 42:46.440
We can't.

42:47.730 --> 42:49.120
Hurry up.

42:53.750 --> 42:54.560
Brother-in-law,

42:55.170 --> 42:56.090
the illness

42:56.120 --> 42:57.900
of Mr. Xie's father happened

42:57.980 --> 42:59.450
at quite an opportune time, didn't it?

43:02.630 --> 43:04.370
Stop looking.
